## Input

```css
@supports ($: grid) {
  .incomplete-variable {
    display: grid;
  }
}

.after-incomplete-variable {
  display: block;
}

@supports (#{} and (display: grid)) {
  .empty-interpolation {
    display: grid;
  }
}

.after-empty-interpolation {
  display: block;
}

$property: display;

@supports ($property: grid {
  .missing-query-close {
    display: grid;
  }
}

.after-missing-query-close {
  display: block;
}

```


